  "earned_statement": "Both gauge-related presentations of the selected 011q central extension reconstruct D8. Each admits exactly eight group isomorphisms to the native local D8, giving sixteen isomorphisms in total. Every isomorphism maps the local central flip to the unique nonidentity native center a. The local central flip changes the two-sided slider coordinate, whereas native a lies in the kernel of the 011o alpha_1 orientation-sheet character. Thus no direct marked identification of the local central side with the 011o orientation sheet exists. This center-action obstruction does not rule out a broader relation mediated by an intermediate bridge.",
